Looking for audio visual rental for remote presentations in Malaga? This is smaller than a full virtual event: one remote speaker or participant joining an otherwise in-person room, a boardroom Q&A with someone calling in, or a presenter addressing a room where a few attendees are remote. The room still needs sound so people can hear the call, a screen so they can see it, and a way to plug a laptop into both.

We handle delivery, installation and testing of that room setup throughout Malaga and along the Costa del Sol. The call itself is on you: bring your own laptop, video conferencing software and internet connection.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear provides audio visual rental for remote presentations in Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol: room sound, a screen and laptop connectivity for a remote speaker or participant joining an in-person meeting or presentation. With a track record stretching back to 1996, our crew handles delivery, installation and testing of the room setup, so all you need to bring is the laptop and the call.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

